          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Global cybersecurity gap widens as AI-powered attacks surge and defensive tools remain unevenly distributed",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Rest of World reports that restricted access to powerful AI-based defensive security tools — including Anthropic's Mythos platform — is leaving companies, central banks, and governments in lower-income countries significantly more exposed to AI-powered cyberattacks. As offensive AI capabilities spread faster than defensive ones, a structural cybersecurity inequality is emerging between nations. Experts warn this gap could destabilise financial systems and critical infrastructure in vulnerable economies.",
            "url": "https://restofworld.org/2026/ai-cybersecurity-anthropic-mythos/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=feeds",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
